{"ea": "0045ad20", "module": "m45AAF0", "code": "aa64a7791808b202", "ok": false, "issues": ["0x0045AD33-0x0045AD3A: the original passes the return value of GetGlobalValue_4FBDE0 as the `this` pointer for QueryIndexedValue_4FC160 (`call 0x4fbde0; mov ecx, eax; call 0x4fc160`). The reimplementation discards that return value and passes nullptr as self (ECX = 0), so the callee runs on a null object instead of the global one. It should be `QueryIndexedValue_4FC160((void*)GetGlobalValue_4FBDE0(), nullptr, 1)`."], "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "date": "2026-10-09"}
